# branch-tasks tooling — dropped in locally by `make bundle-tools BUNDLE=verter-client` from the
# sibling ../infrastructure checkout (see its bin/gen-bundle-tooling), never committed here:
# this is a library with no deploy pipeline/CI of its own beyond the existing build/test
# workflows, and nobody but the developer who pulled it ever looks at BRANCH_TASKS.md
# (markdown, not HTML like the app-services — opens straight in the editor). Re-run that
# command any time these are missing or you want the latest version of the script.
# (.github/workflows/branch-tasks.yml is the opposite — committed on purpose, see that file's
# own header.)
/branch-tasks.sh
/Makefile
/BRANCH_TASKS.md

# Personal Makefile variable overrides (e.g. MAIN_BRANCH/TICKET_REGEX for branch-tasks).
# Auto-picked up via -include in the generated Makefile.
/Makefile.local
